From: CEB-GNRD maintainers <bmc@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] http: allow same-origin KVM fullscreen

The board Web UI offers a KVM fullscreen button. The default HTML
Permissions-Policy disables fullscreen entirely, causing Chromium-based
browsers to reject requestFullscreen with a policy violation.

Allow fullscreen only for the response origin. Keep the remaining
permissions and the existing frame embedding restrictions unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD Web UI feature]
---
--- a/include/security_headers.hpp
+++ b/include/security_headers.hpp
@@ -40,7 +40,7 @@
             "display-capture=(),"
             "document-domain=(),"
             "encrypted-media=(),"
-            "fullscreen=(),"
+            "fullscreen=(self),"
             "gamepad=(),"
             "geolocation=(),"
             "gyroscope=(),"
